### Login (JWT for the protected /api/** calls below)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jwt.gate@eh8s.local",
  "password": "eh8s-dev-pass1"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Latest digest without Bearer must be 401
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/owner/digest/latest?walletPubkey=7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC

### Latest digest for a non-owner wallet must be 403
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/owner/digest/latest?walletPubkey=YmTYQJifjP2DawdxDUYuNCZJ5to9ge5nNGaWGW2ozJU
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Latest digest for the owner: { aiConfigured, model, latest }
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/owner/digest/latest?walletPubkey=7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Generate today's digest: 503 "AI digest unavailable: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY not set" without a key, 200 with the stored digest when set
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/owner/digest/run
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC"
}
